{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/47844-wraith-which-cities-would-you-like-to-see-as-necropoli","id":47844,"title":"Wraith: which cities would you like to see as Necropoli?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-12T20:27:52-08:00","id":47844,"title":"Wraith: which cities would you like to see as Necropoli?","content":"Due to the unique structure of the Shadowlands, living cities have their grim echoes for wraiths to live in. Buildings that have been destroyed stand in the Shadowlands, causing modern cities to instead appear as anachronistic hodgepodges. I quite like this, but we never got much material on them - Atlanta got a book, and the final Orpheus book presented a post-6GM New York (if I recall) - but few others. What cities do you think would make for the moste exciting Necropoli? Remember; the older and more troubled, the better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T21:03:36-08:00","id":47875,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Baghdad, Iraq (not to be confused with Bagdad, AZ). <br /> <br /> The last decade or so notwithstanding, there's been a lot of crap happening there since little huts popped up between those two rivers...</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T21:45:01-08:00","id":47909,"title":"","content":"I asked something similar in the thread titled &quot;Wraith Splats that never were&quot; I'll say now as I did then, I'd like to see necropolis San Fransisco if only for the Wraith treatment on the island of Alcatraz. Though the rest of SF had some dark, or should I say rather Burning history of its own, Alcatraz island is hands down a terrible place to be on either side of the Shroud.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T21:58:57-08:00","id":47921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/47844-wraith-which-cities-would-you-like-to-see-as-necropoli?p=47909#post47909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I asked something similar in the thread titled &quot;Wraith Splats that never were&quot; I'll say now as I did then, I'd like to see necropolis San Fransisco if only for the Wraith treatment on the island of Alcatraz. Though the rest of SF had some dark, or should I say rather Burning history of its own, Alcatraz island is hands down a terrible place to be on either side of the Shroud.</div> </div> </div> </div>The number of times various ghost hunting shows have gone to haunted prisons have made me want to see one of those sprawling penitentiaries as a Haunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-12T23:15:12-08:00","id":47962,"title":"","content":"would like to see part of Santiago de Chile (the presidential house for example that got bombarded on the 73)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T07:36:07-08:00","id":48155,"title":"","content":"Anywhere that's had one of the major disasters in the past 20 years: Haiti, New Orleans, Japan.....pick one, there's been too many to list, it seems.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T09:58:00-08:00","id":48267,"title":"","content":"what about chernobyl","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T10:18:05-08:00","id":48287,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darling_Rose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/47844-wraith-which-cities-would-you-like-to-see-as-necropoli?p=47909#post47909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I asked something similar in the thread titled &quot;Wraith Splats that never were&quot; I'll say now as I did then, I'd like to see necropolis San Fransisco if only for the Wraith treatment on the island of Alcatraz. Though the rest of SF had some dark, or should I say rather Burning history of its own, Alcatraz island is hands down a terrible place to be on either side of the Shroud.</div> </div> </div> </div>And I mentioned my beef with it too (Due to San Fran having two books already in the CWOD). As Alcatraz was already covered briefly in San Fransisco By Night as a place Wraiths hang out at.<br /> And if you wanted a much older famous prison haunt: Eastern State Penitentiary in Pennslyania.<br /> <br /> If you wanted a California based Nercopolis: You can go with San Diego. Hotel Del Coronado, The Whaley House, mass etc.<br /> <br /> Maybe a Kickstarter goal for Wraith 20th should be Haunts 2.0? That way you could cover a bunch of places at once.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Rage CCG Collector and Artist. Visit the <a href=\"http://rageccg.proboards.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Rage CCG Forums</a>.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img818/5825/w20supportercliath125.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img839/9002/ylxu.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1137-laughing-hyena","name":"Laughing Hyena","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1137_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"236"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T11:42:51-08:00","id":48357,"title":"","content":"Detroit. Yes, I am a broken record.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1819-fallingsnow","name":"FallingSnow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1819_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"24"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-13T16:13:52-08:00","id":48553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/47844-wraith-which-cities-would-you-like-to-see-as-necropoli?p=48267#post48267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what about chernobyl</div> </div> </div> </div>OOOOO that's a good one.<br /> <br /> LH: As a resident I gotta say the SF splats are alright... not great. Definitely needs updating, and really barely scratches the surface of the diversity of the setting. But I am biased. There's several LARPs going on here and groups of people writing up their own material to take advantage of all the setting opportunities across the systems board. I would be ecstatic to see more of The City.<br /> <br /> However I do agree, eastern state is another great location that would make a great splat. Course this thread is asking about Necropoli, so it should involve the entire region. Are there enough locations of the area to make a great city of the dead?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/31/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><a href=\"http://glyphery.webs.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ut0SZ4h.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1332-darling_rose","name":"Darling_Rose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1332_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"434"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T06:32:12-08:00","id":48915,"title":"","content":"IF I were looking at cities for Necropoli - and I confess, that's way down on the priority chart at this point - the key things I would be looking for would be A)a long and varied history B)enough cachet that folks would be excited about playing there and C)the ability to do the city respectfully and well.<br /> <br /> But, if we're spitballing here - and that is ALL we are doing, honest - my list starts with Paris. <br /> <br /> Because Catacombs.<br /> <br /> Deadguy out","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1052-realdeadguy","name":"RealDeadguy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1052_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T10:54:09-08:00","id":49129,"title":"","content":"Florence: the city conquered by the Spectre in the first '900 and retaken by the hierarchy after 2 crusades","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>====================================<br /> &quot;Worst English-language User&quot; 2011-2015, 2017 running for the 2018<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ed6RV6Z.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></div></div> </div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/515-ryoga84","name":"Ryoga84","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar515_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-14T11:19:13-08:00","id":49154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Crowley</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/47844-wraith-which-cities-would-you-like-to-see-as-necropoli?p=48267#post48267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">what about chernobyl</div> </div> </div> </div>Paraduo had the same question. I know for Werewolf it's a active Hive. One thing I suggested to him that since its a Hive you could have Spectres leak through. Most I can recommend is take a look at W20 Rage Across the World. Pg. 76 is all the info on Chernobyl and it's reflection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Onyx Path Kickstarters I back.<br /> W20, MtC, CB20, DtD, MtAs20, BotW20, Wraith 20th.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1442-paladindemo","name":"PaladinDemo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1442_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"622"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T20:01:39-08:00","id":52097,"title":"","content":"Constantinople (if there is ever a Dark Ages Wraith released) or Istanbul (modern setting). It has always kind of annoyed me that Wraith completely ignored the eastern empire.<br /> <br /> After all, throughout the Dark Ages and on into the High Medieval the population of Constantinople alone was more than ten times the population of the largest cities in the West. Sources differ, but at the time of the 4th Crusade the city still had at least 440 000 people and perhaps as many as double that. Imagine the number of Wraiths that ought to have come from the eastern empire, and there is zero mention of it. It is not counted among the first necropolis', even though it should have preexisted them by centuries!<br /> <br /> Numerous fires destroyed important parts of the city throughout history (two &quot;great fires&quot; alone in 1203 and 1204) so the city would be rich in relic buildings, relic items and fresh recruits. Devastating plagues and the destruction and killing alone after the city fell in 1204 and 1453 would provide enough recruits and pathos for a great Wraith setting. In the former case, there was no official body count but the city was significantly depopulated, and in the latter case an eyewitness claimed that so much blood was spilled that &quot;it ran like rainwater in the gutters as if after a sudden storm.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yep, definitely Constantinople...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.obsidianportal.com/campaigns/the-concord-of-ashes\" target=\"_blank\">The Concord of Ashes</a>, my Dark Ages Vampire Chronicle","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1790-haligaunt","name":"Haligaunt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1790_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T21:07:21-08:00","id":52125,"title":"","content":"Istambul? Isnt that constantinople?, So wraiths from constantinople are from istambul now? but they can go back to constantinople ?<br /> <br /> <br /> OK going serious....Will you add the World Trade Center, i know its a touchy subject, What about Gettysburg?, I would like to see places from Chile in the game, we have an stadium in which political prisioners were tortured during the 70's<br /> <br /> What about places like the waco compound or the Suicide Forest from Japan?...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T22:40:32-08:00","id":52156,"title":"","content":"Aokigahara is either a massive Haunt or absolutely infested with Spectres.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0